# OpenMontage — optional configuration
#
# There are no API keys here, and that is the point. Every tool runs locally and
# reproducibly: the same project renders the same frames, offline, at no cost.
# Copy this to `.env` only if you want to override one of the defaults below.

# --- Paths ---
# Where production workspaces are created. Default: ./projects
# OPENMONTAGE_PROJECTS_DIR=

# Royalty-free music you provide. Default: ./music_library
# The music_library tool stays unavailable until this folder holds at least one
# audio file (.mp3 .wav .m4a .aac .flac .ogg .opus .aiff); subfolders are fine.
# MUSIC_LIBRARY_DIR=

# --- Local runtimes ---
# Blender executable for blender_world (3D world rendering). Auto-detected from
# PATH and the usual install locations; set this only if yours lives elsewhere.
# BLENDER_PATH=

# Port for the Backlot board, the local server that shows a production live.
# Default: 8765
# BACKLOT_PORT=

# --- Optional ---
# Hugging Face token, used only to download speech models for `transcriber`.
# Anonymous downloads normally work; set this if you hit a rate limit.
# HF_TOKEN=
